(DNS Resolution) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DNS is a distributed system that translates domain names into IP addresses. A recursive) Tj T*
(resolver queries root servers, then top level domain servers, then the authoritative) Tj T*
(name server for the domain. Resolvers cache answers for the time set by the TTL value,) Tj T*
(which reduces lookup latency and load on name servers.) Tj T*
ET
